{"unit_id":"QQ-M__dsh-skill-market#card-zh","repo":"QQ-M/dsh-skill-market","commit":"8fa51ed574c10f978df85798cc48fbebc8d5d406","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-market 是一款面向 DSH 网页客户端的技能市场插件，在设置页提供技能搜索与管理界面，并由宿主 API 连接 GitHub。用户可按关键词搜索技能仓库、查看仓库中可识别的 SKILL.md 布局、粘贴仓库地址检查技能，并将单技能或多技能仓库安装到本机配置目录。已安装列表支持查看技能说明与路径，也可逐项卸载并移入可手动恢复的暂存目录。适合希望从 DSH 网页设置页发现、安装和整理 GitHub 技能的用户。搜索可使用可选 GitHub token；技能默认安装到 ~/.dsh/skills。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:215-339","client.js:400-425","index.js:124-187","index.js:226-278","index.js:302-328","index.js:418-427"]}
{"unit_id":"QQ-M__dsh-skill-market#card-en","repo":"QQ-M/dsh-skill-market","commit":"8fa51ed574c10f978df85798cc48fbebc8d5d406","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skill-market adds a skill market to DSH web settings. Search GitHub, inspect a pasted URL for skills, install them locally, and view or uninstall installed items. Uninstall moves a skill to staging. An optional GitHub token supports searches; skills default to ~/.dsh/skills.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:215-339","client.js:400-425","index.js:124-187","index.js:226-278","index.js:302-328","index.js:418-427"]}
