{"unit_id":"QQ-M__dsh-skill-market#feature-1","repo":"QQ-M/dsh-skill-market","commit":"8fa51ed574c10f978df85798cc48fbebc8d5d406","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-market 的功能「搜索技能仓库」：在设置页输入关键词或留空浏览技能仓库，结果按技能相关标记和星数排序并分页显示。输入关键词后点击搜索或按 Enter 即可查看仓库名称、描述和星数。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:352-359","client.js:393-399","index.js:124-187","index.js:365-375"]}
{"unit_id":"QQ-M__dsh-skill-market#feature-2","repo":"QQ-M/dsh-skill-market","commit":"8fa51ed574c10f978df85798cc48fbebc8d5d406","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-market 的功能「检查仓库并安装技能」：粘贴 GitHub 仓库链接可先检查默认分支和技能文件布局，也可直接安装搜索结果。确认后，插件下载仓库归档，并将根目录技能或 skills 子目录中的技能复制到配置的安装目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:360-387","client.js:304-339","index.js:194-220","index.js:226-278"]}
{"unit_id":"QQ-M__dsh-skill-market#feature-3","repo":"QQ-M/dsh-skill-market","commit":"8fa51ed574c10f978df85798cc48fbebc8d5d406","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-market 的功能「查看与卸载已安装技能」：切换到已安装标签页可查看技能名称、说明和路径；选择卸载后，该技能会从列表中移到安装目录下的暂存名称，便于之后手动恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:400-408","index.js:302-328","index.js:403-409"]}
{"unit_id":"QQ-M__dsh-skill-market#caveat-1","repo":"QQ-M/dsh-skill-market","commit":"8fa51ed574c10f978df85798cc48fbebc8d5d406","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-market 使用前须知：搜索请求会访问 GitHub API，安装时还会从 codeload.github.com 下载所选仓库归档；安装的技能文件会写入配置的本机目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:40-41","index.js:149-177","index.js:231-247"]}
